{"product_id":"geekvape-aegis-n30-30w-pod-system","title":"GeekVape N30 30W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover the Geek Vape NANO 30W Starter Kit, featuring an 800mAh battery, 5-30W output range, and a 2mL capacity pod with integrated coil.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConstructed from durable zinc-alloy, the Aegis Nano is extremely compact and portable, making it the perfect option for someone who is on-the-go or traveling. Equipped with an integrated 800mAh battery, the NANO delivers 5-30W output and is perfect for use with the 2mL pods. Offering a 0.6ohm or 1.2ohm integrated coil pod, the top fill system is hidden beneath the mouthpiece and offers an adjustable airflow control switch.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGeek Vape NANO 30W Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 86.5mm by 24mm by 22.5mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 800mAh Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWattage Output Range: 5-30W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVoltage Output Range: 0.1-6.0V\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistance Range: 0.2-3.0ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTemperature Range: 100°-315°C \/ 200°-600°F\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eZinc-Alloy Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntuitive Firing Button\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.69\" OLED Display Screen\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLanyard Attachment Point\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdjustable Airflow Switch\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGeek Vape Nano Pod Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Refillable Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSilicone Stoppered\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Fill System - Hidden Under Mouthpiece\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 0.6ohm Mesh Coil - rated for 23W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 1.2ohm MTL Coil - rated for 11-14W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSnap-In Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShort-Circuit Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Voltage Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOverheat Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShort-Circuit Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Battery Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOverheating Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType-C Charging\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in Hunter Green\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Geek Vape Nano\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 0.6ohm Mesh Coil Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 1.2ohm MTL Coil Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 MicroUSB Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Geekvape","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41775202435127,"sku":"GeekV N30 Pod System","price":4550.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/geek_vape_-_nano_-_pod_system_-_all_colors.png?v=1752511367","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/geekvape-aegis-n30-30w-pod-system","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




